     a) The student has a CGPA of 8.5 or above and attendance of 85 percent or above.
     b) The student has won a national-level competition
     the program should take CGPA , attendance percentage and national-level competeion status as input,then display whether the student is eligible for scholarship



cgpa = float(input("Enter CGPA: "))
